{"id":"661957","name":"干煸菜花","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/661957/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花椰菜","amount":"半个"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青蒜","amount":"1棵"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"花椰面反复洗净。","img":"images/661957/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成小朵。","img":"images/661957/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜、蒜切成片。","img":"images/661957/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"干红椒切段，用厨房用纸擦干净。","img":"images/661957/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将花椰菜炒去水份。","img":"images/661957/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"已去除水份的状态。","img":"images/661957/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅里加入适量食用油烧热，放入姜、蒜片、及干红椒炒香。","img":"images/661957/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒出香味。","img":"images/661957/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再放入一勺豆酱、一勺蚝油。","img":"images/661957/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将料炒香。","img":"images/661957/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入花椰菜翻炒，加入青蒜、小红椒片、鸡精快速翻炒。","img":"images/661957/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将菜品盛入盘中。","img":"images/661957/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}